Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 梅格 - 好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Meg. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.27,0:00:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你和乔一起猎鬼了 - 是啊 有一段时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You were hunting with jo? - Yeah, for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.14,0:00:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那群傻瓜现在已经熔了那把枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mooks have melted down the gun by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.01,0:00:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到的可不是这样的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I hear differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.24,0:00:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你还想继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you are still set on the insane task.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.74,0:00:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯狂的猎杀任务的话 我们就得这么干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of killing the devil, this is how we do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.24,0:00:21.45,Title,0,0,0,0,,在《凶鬼恶灵》第33章里 那个女孩儿贝拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}In chapter 33 of "supernatural, " there was that girl bela.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.48,0:00:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她从你那里偷了科尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}She stole the colt from you,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.75,0:00:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后她说过把它给了莉莉丝 还记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then she "said" she gave it to lilith, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.78,0:00:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 那你知道她说谎了 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Well, you know she lied, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.72,0:00:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她从来没有把它交给莉莉丝 - 你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She never really gave it to lilith. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.99,0:00:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝拉把科尔特给了一个叫克劳力的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bela gives the colt to a demon named crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.92,0:00:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎有能力的影视爱好者加入我们字幕组\N{\fnArial\fs30}加入仅凭个人兴趣爱好 没有任何金钱实质回报
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.75,0:01:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是彭德尔顿先生吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Pendleton, I presume.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.07,0:01:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}The name's crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.20,0:01:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的谈判中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-in my negotiations, I was, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.22,0:01:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是和一位非常年轻性感的女士做的交易啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dealing with a very young, attractive, uh, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.83,0:01:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.76,0:01:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你 贪心的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you, piggy banker…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.70,0:01:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是一条大鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…Are a big fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.97,0:01:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想亲自来完成这个交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wanted to do you the honor of sealing this deal personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.17,0:01:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她说这个交易需要以吻来结尾\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she said the deal would be sealed with a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.42,0:01:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.67,0:01:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我的意思是 她\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I mean, she's …
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.11,0:01:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.45,0:01:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以保留60年来根深蒂固的憎恶同性恋情结\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can cling to six decades of deep-seated homophobia.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.05,0:01:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者放弃它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or just give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.19,0:01:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急援助你的可怜的岌岌可危的银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}And get a complete bailout of your bank's ridiculous incompetence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.99,0:01:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are just things …
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.86,0:01:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我数一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going once…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.17,0:01:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.57,0:01:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going twice …
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.57,0:01:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.94,0:01:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.34,0:02:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.70,0:02:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔克劳力正在做交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon crowley is making a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.27,0:02:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,正当我们说话的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even as we speak, it's…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.30,0:02:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经完成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going…Down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.47,0:02:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,完成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Going down"?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.24,0:02:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.34,0:02:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 只是不要跟丢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, huggy bear. Just don't lose him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.08,0:02:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会跟丢他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't lose him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.41,0:02:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,太恶心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.55,0:02:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好享受这恶心的财富\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy the obscene wealth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.58,0:02:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,10年后我来看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you in 10 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.10,0:02:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟着他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I followed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.27,0:03:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是很远 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not far, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.81,0:03:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,墙被巫术分隔着\N{\fnArial\fs30}…It's layered in chian warding magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.43,0:03:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我进不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.35,0:03:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了 你做得很好 我们这就过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay. You did great. We'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.79,0:03:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.96,0:03:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我的车坏了 我需要帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? My car broke down. I-i need some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.89,0:03:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be down in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.34,0:04:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 靓妞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evening, pretty lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.81,0:04:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那么拘谨当这里是自己家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get yourself on in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.71,0:04:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是需要打个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need to make a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.82,0:04:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要打电话 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need to call anyone, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.35,0:04:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是你需要的唯一帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the only help you're ever gonna need.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.98,0:04:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.49,0:04:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我还是应该等在我的车旁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I should wait by my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.66,0:04:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,说了你要留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We said get your ass in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.34,0:04:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,干的不错 乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice work, jo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.67,0:04:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢夸奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.48,0:04:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 一起走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.72,0:05:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是克劳力 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's "crowley, " right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.23,0:05:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你们还是找到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…The hardy boys finally found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.20,0:05:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,等候多时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took you long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.25,0:05:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道这小毛毯会带给你们什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea how much this rug costs?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.56,0:05:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了这个 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.83,0:05:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你们要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what it's all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.68,0:05:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.31,0:05:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我们三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Privately.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.82,0:06:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是搞什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.15,0:06:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我能把这玩意儿埋多深吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how deep I could have buried this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.16,0:06:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全没理由让你们谁知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no reason you or anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.93,0:06:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西还存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should know this even exists at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.63,0:06:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非我告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except that I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.30,0:06:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告知我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.10,0:06:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,谣言 讥讽 消息不胫而走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rumors, innuendo… Sent out on the grapevine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.45,0:06:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,为啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.94,0:06:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,为啥要告知我们这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why tell us anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.94,0:06:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让你们拿它去对付路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to take this thing to Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.01,0:06:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,打他个脑开花\N{\fnArial\fs30}And empty it into his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.02,0:06:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.32,0:06:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何你这样要他死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why exactly would you want the devil dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.36,0:06:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.49,0:06:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.13,0:06:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我忘了 你们俩最多也就是有点用的智障\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I forgot … you two, at best, are functional morons.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.86,0:06:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 有点用的智障\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're functioning…Morons.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.43,0:06:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,低能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mor…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.90,0:06:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法不是恶魔 忘了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer isn't a demon, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.34,0:06:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an angel …
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.64,0:06:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,以憎恨人类闻名的一个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}An angel famous for his hatred of humankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.04,0:07:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,对他而言 你们俩只是 污秽的脓包而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}To him, you're just… Filthy bags of pus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.21,0:07:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,若他真是这么看待你们的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's the way he feels about you…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.72,0:07:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他又会如何看待我们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}…What can he think about us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.02,0:07:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他诞生了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he created you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.09,0:07:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能算是他的奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}To him, we're just servants.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.12,0:07:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,有价值的材料而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cannon fodder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.83,0:07:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果路西法决定消灭人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Lucifer manages to exterminate humankind…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.80,0:07:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来就是我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…We're next.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.33,0:07:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.54,0:07:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.01,0:07:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们回去那个简单 又比现在好过的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's all go back to simpler, better times.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.94,0:07:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到那个性本善的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to…When we could all follow our natures.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.01,0:07:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 我都在推销了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in sales, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.11,0:07:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你们是怎么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.12,0:07:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.25,0:07:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把这玩意儿给你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give you this thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.09,0:07:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们去灭了恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you go kill the devil?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.60,0:07:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.60,0:07:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.90,0:07:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会正好也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't happen to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.60,0:08:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些恶魔在哪儿 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the devil is, by chance, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.47,0:08:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,礼拜四\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.14,0:08:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯蒂斯告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Birdies tell me…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.21,0:08:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有个在密苏里州迦太基的约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has an appointment in carthage, missouri.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.35,0:08:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.52,0:08:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.46,0:08:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 你们可能需要点子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, right. You probably need some more ammunition.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.17,0:08:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我问一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, excuse me for asking,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.93,0:08:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这算不算是给自己的死刑定了个期呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But aren't you kind of signing your own death warrant?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.07,0:08:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是指 在我们跟恶魔决斗后输了的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what happens to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.81,0:08:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we go up against the devil and lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.71,0:08:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一 他会把我们全扫光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number one … he's gonna wipe us all out anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.41,0:08:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二 你们离开这里之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two … after you leave here,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.18,0:08:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些那些无处不在的约会还等着我继续长期旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I go on an extended vacation to all points nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.05,0:08:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三 不如你们别失败呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And three … how about you don't miss?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.52,0:08:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.95,0:08:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,低能们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morons!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.94,0:09:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 开始了 大人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, big boy. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.38,0:09:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像开始感觉到一些东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm starting to feel something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.19,0:09:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个套 对不\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got to be a trap, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.79,0:09:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆·温彻斯特与恶魔产生了信任危机啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Winchester having trust issues with a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.46,0:09:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,也好 亡羊补牢 为时不晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, better late than never.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.95,0:09:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,十分感谢你一如既往的支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and thank you again for your continued support.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.73,0:09:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.67,0:09:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 不管是不是套\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, you know, trap or no trap,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.07,0:09:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这都是在滚雪球 开始了就得继续 对不\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a snowball's chance, we got to take it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.48,0:09:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我想也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.55,0:09:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,况且 我觉得这不一定是个套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, I'm not sure it is a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.85,0:09:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.95,0:09:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,迦太基就像是棵带着被揭示预兆的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carthage is lit up like a christmas tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.89,0:09:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞树\N{\fnArial\fs30}With revelation omens.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.52,0:09:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.16,0:10:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,周日以来有六起失踪人口\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been six missing persons reported.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.66,0:10:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,被报了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}In town since sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.63,0:10:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔应该就在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the devil's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.43,0:10:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.50,0:10:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你仔细想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, when you think about it…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.91,0:10:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是别跟来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…You can't come with.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.47,0:10:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.58,0:10:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我去找撒旦然后搞定他这个狗杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I go get satan and screw the pooch…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.08,0:10:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.68,0:10:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经输掉一个不应该输的筹码了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've lost a game piece that we can take.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.35,0:10:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,可如果你在那的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you're there…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.72,0:10:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就等于我们把恶魔皮囊双手奉上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we are handing the devil's vessel right over to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.55,0:10:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不太明智了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.76,0:10:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们什么时候做过明智的事儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when have we ever done anything smart?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.39,0:10:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认真的 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm serious, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.86,0:10:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So am i.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.16,0:10:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是有过一次教训了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't we learned a damn thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.89,0:10:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果要做这事儿 那我们就一起做\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're gonna do this, we're gonna do it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.34,0:10:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.91,0:10:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这主意真是愚蠢到家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a stupid friggin' idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.79,0:11:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄 我们在说那个蠢到家的主意呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy. Talk about stupid ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.89,0:11:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good god.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.16,0:11:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这的确是\N{\fnArial\fs30}True, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.54,0:11:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.47,0:11:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天任务艰巨啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dangerous misson tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.78,0:11:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess it's time to…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.88,0:11:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃饭 喝酒 还有 你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat, drink, and… You know…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.98,0:11:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻欢作乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make merry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.52,0:11:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在说这是地球上的最后一晚了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you giving me the "last night on earth" speech?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.12,0:11:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.29,0:11:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.09,0:11:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.59,0:11:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.76,0:11:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我就是那意思的话 那 它有用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I was, would, uh… W-would that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.84,0:11:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.34,0:12:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,甜心儿 如果这是我们地球上的最后一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetheart, if this is our last night on earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.14,0:12:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我会和一种叫做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'm going to spend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.88,0:12:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,自重的东西一起度过\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a little thing I call "self-respect."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.89,0:12:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,可前提是你得有那东西啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you' into that kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.79,0:12:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, get in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.99,0:12:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,该排队喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time for the lineup.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.99,0:12:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,平常的嫌疑犯 站到那个角去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Usual suspects, in the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.79,0:12:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.43,0:12:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,又没人想照相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody wants their picture taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.40,0:12:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.47,0:12:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 你喝的可是我的酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up. You're drinkin' my beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.24,0:12:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.57,0:12:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得需要点东西来记住你们这些讨厌鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need something to remember your sorry asses by.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.04,0:12:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个乐天派在这儿可真够棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always good to have an optimist around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.91,0:12:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.18,0:12:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天我们就要去猎杀那个恶魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow we hunt the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.17,0:12:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们在地球的最后一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our last night on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.02,0:13:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有信号吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You getting a signal?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.65,0:13:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.38,0:13:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是够吓人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice and spooky.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.56,0:13:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方看上去是不是有点空旷啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place seem a little empty to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.26,0:13:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去警察局看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna go check out the pd.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.63,0:13:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们呆在这儿看能不能找到别的什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys stay here see if you can find anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.63,0:13:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.81,0:13:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说过有种东西叫门把手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever heard of a door handle?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.95,0:13:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.95,0:13:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it, cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.33,0:14:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个小镇并不是没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This town's not empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.39,0:14:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,死神们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.29,0:14:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,死神们 就是说不只一个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Reapers"? As in more than one?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.10,0:14:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只有在发生重大灾难的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}They only gather like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.03,0:14:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,才会像这样聚集起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}At times of great catastrophe …
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.30,0:14:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,芝加哥大火灾 旧金山地震\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chicago fire, san francisco quake…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.43,0:14:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,庞贝城（因火山爆发而灭城的意大利古都）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pompeii.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.04,0:14:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我失礼 我要去查清楚他们怎么会在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. I need to find out why they're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.11,0:15:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.43,0:15:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察局没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Station's empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.76,0:15:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,别的地方也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So is everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.00,0:15:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看见卡西了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.13,0:15:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 他和你们在一起的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? He was with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.80,0:15:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 他去找死神了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. He went after the reapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.70,0:15:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reapers?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.87,0:15:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看见死神了吗 在什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saw reapers? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.54,0:15:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个 应该说是 到处都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, kind of… Everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.33,0:15:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.06,0:15:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我想你是和温彻斯特兄弟一起来的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I take it you're here with the winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.14,0:16:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.84,0:16:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.62,0:16:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个时代里这可真是难得的品质了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a nice quality to see in this day and age.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.69,0:16:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是卡西迪奥 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}"castiel, " right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.29,0:16:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.06,0:16:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人跟我说你是坐车来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm told you came here in an automobile.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.27,0:16:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.73,0:16:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那感觉怎么样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that like?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.17,0:16:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.77,0:16:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,受拘谨的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confining.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.07,0:16:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真够奇怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a peculiar thing you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.61,0:16:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的皮囊怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with your vessel?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.38,0:16:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.28,0:16:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得尼克有点紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick is wearing a bit thin, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.46,0:16:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不可能一直容纳着我 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't contain me forever, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.96,0:16:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You …
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.13,0:16:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你休想占有萨姆·温切斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not taking Sam Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.80,0:16:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你得逞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't let you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.24,0:16:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.07,0:17:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白你干嘛要跟我对着干\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand why you're fighting me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.17,0:17:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是单枪匹马得来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off all the angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.58,0:17:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是拿我开涮吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really have to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.31,0:17:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叛乱了 被驱逐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I rebelled. I was cast out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.15,0:17:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也叛变了 也被驱逐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You rebelled. You were cast out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.25,0:17:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂里的人个个都巴不得我死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost all of heaven wants to see me dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.65,0:17:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果真如他们所愿了 猜猜会怎么着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if they succeed, guess what.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.59,0:17:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会晋升为他们眼中的头号大敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're their new public enemy number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.79,0:17:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在的处境相同 不管你喜欢与否 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on the same side, like it or not, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.16,0:17:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛不为自己多考虑考虑呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not just serve your own best interests?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.40,0:17:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一你有一天 不得不沦落成我这样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which, in this case, just happen to be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.25,0:17:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会一死了之\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll die first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.21,0:17:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看你确实是离死不远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.55,0:17:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是棒极了 我们都在这城里转悠了20分钟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is great. We've been in town for 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.40,0:17:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们的风衣天使没得救了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've already lost the angel up our sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.76,0:17:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为 是路西法抓了他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think, uh… You think Lucifer got him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.61,0:17:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没什么头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what else to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.84,0:18:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你们几个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.65,0:18:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meg!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.35,0:18:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不该来这儿的 帅小伙们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't have come here, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.84,0:18:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 那是我想对你说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Well, I could say the same thing for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.10,0:18:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别只身过来 小迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't come here alone, Dean-o.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.64,0:18:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱之犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hellhounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.81,0:18:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 迪恩 你的最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Dean … your favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.99,0:18:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来 帅小伙们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.13,0:18:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸想见你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father wants to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.52,0:18:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们没空 谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we'll pass. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.16,0:18:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.50,0:18:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是要让事情简单化\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can make this easy,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.87,0:18:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是非常非常地复杂化 都在于你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you can make it really, really hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.74,0:18:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过我们选简单之路走过了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}When have you known us to ever make anything easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.36,0:18:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.66,0:19:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.86,0:19:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔 别过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jo, stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.77,0:19:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.25,0:19:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了 没事了 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Okay, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.77,0:19:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸 保持呼吸 保持呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe, breathe, breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.69,0:19:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.09,0:19:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,小伙子们 这需要帮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys, need some help here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.20,0:19:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,快快快 动作快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go go go…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.65,0:20:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事儿的 你会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be all right. Okay? You're gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.24,0:20:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.75,0:20:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她撑得住吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's she holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.89,0:20:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些盐线撑得住吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The salt lines are holding up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.26,0:20:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在绝对没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.54,0:20:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 安全得像个瓮中之鳖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, safe or trapped like rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.20,0:20:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你也听到梅格说的话了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you heard Meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.86,0:20:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他父亲在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her father's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.52,0:20:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的一次机会 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our one shot, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.93,0:20:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何 我们都要抓住机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to take it, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.72,0:20:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.40,0:20:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 过来帮帮我 行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, some help here, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.44,0:20:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所拨打的号码是空号\N{\fnArial\fs30}The number you dialed is unavailable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.66,0:20:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你查询后再拨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please try your call again…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.42,0:20:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的 臭小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.71,0:21:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是福克斯三角洲的KC5号 请讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kc5 Fox Delta Oscar, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.52,0:21:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 我是迪恩 我们有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, it's Dean. We got problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.96,0:21:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 孩子 这就是我在这里的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, boy. That's why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.47,0:21:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everyone all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.59,0:21:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.33,0:21:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 乔的情况很糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Jo. Bobby, it's pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.15,0:21:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.51,0:21:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们考虑接下来做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now we figure what we do next.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.57,0:21:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 我想她不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, I don't think she's …
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.68,0:21:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 接下来做什么 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, "what do we do next, " Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.08,0:21:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.12,0:21:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.76,0:21:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 告诉我你们的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now… Tell me what you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.56,0:22:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,在卡西失踪之前 他说过有多少死神吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before he went missing, did Cass say how many reapers?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.36,0:22:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.07,0:22:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说了很多 我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said a lot of things, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.09,0:22:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 死神数目重要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, does the number matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.34,0:22:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,详细描述恶魔 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Devil's in the details, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.72,0:22:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 我是艾伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, it's Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.43,0:22:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥看死神时的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way he was looking,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.59,0:22:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有他目光所到之处的数目\N{\fnArial\fs30}The number of places Castiel's eyes went,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.76,0:22:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得说我们说的是超过一打死神 也许更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say we're talking over a dozen reapers … probably more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.59,0:22:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢那种声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not like the sound of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.22,0:22:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人喜欢那声音 但是 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody likes the sound of that, Bobby, but …
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.84,0:22:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 那究竟是什么状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What … what does that sound like?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.73,0:22:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来像是死亡骑士 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sounds like death, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.17,0:22:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得路西法准备在镇上举行仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think satan's in town to work a ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.78,0:22:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要释放死亡骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he's planning to unleash death.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.70,0:22:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能有比这家伙还有缴税\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, like, as in this dude and.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.13,0:22:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,更确定一点的事情吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}taxes are the only sure thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.78,0:22:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是指死亡骑士 天启四骑士中的灰色骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in death … the horseman, the pale rider in the flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.14,0:22:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才说「解放」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Unleash"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.84,0:22:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是指 死亡不是无处不在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, h-hasn't death been tromping all over the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.00,0:22:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 见鬼 我不都死了好几回吗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, hell, I died several times myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.19,0:22:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.24,0:22:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是 是地狱男爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is … this is the angel of death,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.53,0:23:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以说是死神之父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big daddy reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.00,0:23:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被拘禁在深深的地底\N{\fnArial\fs30}They keep this guy chained in a box 600 feet under.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.99,0:23:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,上一次把他上来的时候 诺亚造了一艘船呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time they hauled him up, Noah was building a boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.07,0:23:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪那鬼地方满是死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why the place is crawling with reapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.15,0:23:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在等候老大的出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're waiting on the big boss to show.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.94,0:23:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么好消息吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have any other good news?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.70,0:23:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,某种意义上来说是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, in a manner of speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.35,0:23:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们走后 我一直在研究迦太基的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been researching carthage since you've been gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.79,0:23:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,试图查清路西法的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to suss out what the devil might want there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.34,0:23:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才所说的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you just said drops the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.88,0:23:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好解开了最后的谜团\N{\fnArial\fs30}piece of the puzzle in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.55,0:23:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,召唤地狱男爵的条件是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angel of death must be brought into this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.64,0:23:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,午夜时间 进行一场可怕的大屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}At midnight through a place of awful carnage.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.23,0:23:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,回顾到内战时期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, back during the civil war,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.61,0:23:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,迦太基发生过一场大战\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a battle in carthage …
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.50,0:23:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场战斗极其惨烈\N{\fnArial\fs30}A battle so intense,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.80,0:23:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此战士们将其称之为「地狱之战」\N{\fnArial\fs30}The soldiers called it "the battle of hellhole."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.55,0:23:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,大屠杀发生在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd the massacre go down?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.83,0:23:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个地方现在是威廉·贾思博的农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the land of William Jasper's farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.19,0:24:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,温彻斯特一伙人被我牵制住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the Winchesters pinned down …
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.91,0:24:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少目前为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}For now, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.74,0:24:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要对他们做些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What should I do with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.58,0:24:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用管他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave them alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.83,0:24:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白 你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I'm sorry, but are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.44,0:24:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't we …
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.02,0:24:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, child.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.71,0:24:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,万事皆有因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything happens for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.38,0:24:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Castiel…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.78,0:24:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.25,0:24:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,来改变主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to change your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.28,0:24:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然我们知道了恶魔会在何时\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, now we know where the devil's gonna be,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.08,0:24:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,何地出现 我们还有科尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know when, and we have the colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.11,0:24:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.83,0:24:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过要在午夜前赶到农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just have to get past… Eight or so hellhounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.22,0:24:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要甩掉八多条地狱犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}And get to the farm by midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.71,0:24:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我们还得先把乔和艾伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and that's after we get Jo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.90,0:24:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,送出这个鬼地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Ellen the hell out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.37,0:24:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.58,0:24:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,用担架吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stretcher?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.92,0:24:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去看看我们有些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see what we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.29,0:25:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.21,0:25:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.95,0:25:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能现实点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we, uh, be realistic about this, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.60,0:25:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的腿无法移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't move my legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.15,0:25:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不能被转移\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be moved.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.49,0:25:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的肠子靠绷带支撑着\N{\fnArial\fs30}My guts are being held in by an ace bandage.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.60,0:25:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.04,0:25:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须先处理这儿的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get our priorities straight here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.43,0:25:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 我哪儿也不能去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number one … I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.61,0:25:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 乔安娜·贝丝 别用这种语气说话 - 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Joanna beth, you stop talking like that - Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.08,0:25:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.28,0:25:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能走路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.83,0:25:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还能做点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.68,0:25:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有丙烷 导火线 石盐和铁钉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got propane, wiring, rock salt, iron nails …
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.53,0:25:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我们来说足够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.28,0:25:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,用来做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything we need?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.32,0:25:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,做一个炸弹 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}To build a bomb, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.74,0:26:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.84,0:26:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jo…No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.74,0:26:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有其他主意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got another plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.16,0:26:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他更好的主意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got any other plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.28,0:26:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面充斥着地狱犬 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are hellhounds out there, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.66,0:26:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们熟悉我们的气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've got all of our scents.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.22,0:26:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些狗杂种会一直追你到天涯海角\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those bitches will never stop coming after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.04,0:26:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们让它们进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We let the dogs in,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.04,0:26:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以从屋顶爬出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys hit the roof,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.71,0:26:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住机会冲向旁边的楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make a break for the building next over,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.08,0:26:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我留在这里引爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can wait here with my finger on the button.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.91,0:26:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那些狗炸得不成样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rip those mutts a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.72,0:26:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者至少让你们有几分钟的领先\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or at least get you a few minutes' head start, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.04,0:26:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不会让你这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, i… I won't let you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.66,0:26:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们来这儿的原因 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is why we're here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.60,0:26:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我可以给恶魔一击\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I can get us a shot on the devil…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.65,0:26:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我们不得不这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, we have to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.33,0:26:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.40,0:27:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not …
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.50,0:27:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.87,0:27:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也许真的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}This might literally be.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.14,0:27:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一次拿我当大人一样对待了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your last chance to treat me like an adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.67,0:27:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也许希望这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might want to take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.31,0:27:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听见她说的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.58,0:27:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始准备吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.79,0:28:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 就是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.83,0:28:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将在另一个世界相会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.81,0:28:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是迟早的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably sooner than later.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.82,0:28:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是晚点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.30,0:29:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.29,0:29:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.48,0:29:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,得有人把它们放进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's got to let them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.68,0:29:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你说的 你动不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And like you said, you're not moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.95,0:30:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有我 乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me, Jo.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.66,0:30:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.36,0:30:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.43,0:30:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不会我丢下你一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I will not leave you here alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.47,0:30:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.27,0:30:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get goin' now, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.92,0:30:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellen?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.50,0:30:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.77,0:30:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.61,0:30:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,打败他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kick it in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.12,0:30:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,要一下一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.33,0:31:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远爱你 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will always love you, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.63,0:31:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.01,0:31:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.55,0:31:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jo…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.66,0:31:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.53,0:31:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.29,0:31:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的好女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.62,0:32:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚回地狱去吧 你们这些丑陋的疯狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can go straight back to hell, you ugly bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.82,0:32:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们知道镇上的那些人怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we know what happened to some of the townspeople.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.38,0:32:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.92,0:32:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.80,0:32:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last words?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.64,0:33:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我没事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.47,0:33:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.48,0:33:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿什么也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here goes nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.11,0:33:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted to see me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.97,0:33:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 在这儿你不需要那把枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Sam, you don't need that gun here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.01,0:33:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我永远不会伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I'd never hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.51,0:33:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.35,0:33:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.85,0:33:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我会伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'd hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.42,0:33:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So suck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.89,0:34:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是从哪里得到枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.60,0:34:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.10,0:34:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说到哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were we?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.57,0:34:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太难过了 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't feel too bad, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.94,0:34:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界万物只有五样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only five things in all of creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.94,0:34:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这枪打不死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That that gun can't kill,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.40,0:34:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我正好是其中之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…I just happen to be one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.42,0:35:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一点儿时间 我就快完成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you give me a minute, I'm almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.72,0:35:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没期望你此时此刻就答应\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't suppose you'd just say "yes" right here and now?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.48,0:35:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束这无聊的对话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}End this whole tiresome discussion?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.11,0:35:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,太疯狂了 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's crazy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.18,0:35:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这永远不会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's never gonna happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.37,0:35:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I don't know, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.16,0:35:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.34,0:35:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我举的这不久就会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it'll happen soon …
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.21,0:35:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,6个月之内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Within six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.35,0:35:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得会在发生在底特律\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think it'll happen… In Detroit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.02,0:35:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你这狗日的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You listen to me, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.77,0:35:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要亲手杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill you myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.11,0:35:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.77,0:35:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把你的心挖出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to rip your heart out!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.33,0:35:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样很好 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.32,0:35:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,燃起心中的怒火\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep fanning that fire in your belly …
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.57,0:35:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有被压抑着的怒火\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that pent-up rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.18,0:35:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是我要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.61,0:35:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.79,0:35:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对这个镇干了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do to this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.24,0:35:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我对这个镇很大方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I was very generous with this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.97,0:36:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个强壮的人符着一个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}One demon for every able-bodied man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.56,0:36:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the rest of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.95,0:36:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}In there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.69,0:36:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道很可怕 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know … it's awful. But…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.44,0:36:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,天启骑士们的需求很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}These horsemen are so demanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.04,0:36:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以就 女人和小孩优先\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it was… Women and children first.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.91,0:36:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你怎看待想我的 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you must think of me, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.41,0:36:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我必须这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.51,0:36:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.38,0:36:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不光是你 所有人都应该理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, of all people, should understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.55,0:36:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.12,0:36:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.39,0:36:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个弟弟 像你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}A brother, like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.15,0:36:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}A younger brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.93,0:36:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱我的兄长\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I had an older brother who I loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.33,0:36:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,确切的说是崇拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idolized, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.07,0:36:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天 我去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one day, I went to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.84,0:36:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我求他支持我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I begged him to stand with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.06,0:37:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是米迦勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And michael…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.59,0:37:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,米迦勒没有这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael turned on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.75,0:37:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,说我是个怪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Called me a freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.22,0:37:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.53,0:37:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他打败了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then he beat me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.05,0:37:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,只因为我与他们不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}All because I was different.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.36,0:37:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我有自己的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I had a mind of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.53,0:37:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,说说看 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me something, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.42,0:37:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来耳熟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any of this sound familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.12,0:37:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.20,0:37:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要等我一下 快到午夜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to excuse me. Midnight is calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.11,0:37:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得完成一个仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have a ritual to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.99,0:37:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪也别去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.49,0:37:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也哪都去不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that you could if you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.81,0:37:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在跟着我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, repeat after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.93,0:38:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们献上自己的生命 血液 灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}We offer up our lives, blood, souls…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.50,0:38:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们献上自己的生命 血液 灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}We offer up our lives, blood, souls…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.50,0:38:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,来作为贡品\N{\fnArial\fs30}…To complete this tribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.73,0:38:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为贡品\N{\fnArial\fs30}…To complete this tribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.64,0:38:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.03,0:38:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是恶魔而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.34,0:38:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来挺高兴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.17,0:38:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna win.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.28,0:38:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能感觉到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.08,0:38:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的那些天使输掉了整个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cloud-hopping pansies lost the whole damn universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.65,0:38:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法要接管天堂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer's gonna take over heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.49,0:39:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去天堂了 天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're goin' to heaven, clarence.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.30,0:39:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不一定吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.93,0:39:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从克劳力那里听到的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I heard a different theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.19,0:39:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是完全不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}From a demon named Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.63,0:39:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不了解Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.03,0:39:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得路西法只是利用恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}He believes that lucifer is just using demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.81,0:39:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,去开启末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}To achieve an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.68,0:39:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.64,0:39:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一旦达到了目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Once he does…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.88,0:39:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会灭了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}…He'll destroy you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.55,0:39:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.88,0:39:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法是我们的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer is the father of our race …
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.48,0:39:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的缔造者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our creator.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.87,0:39:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的上帝可能游手好闲 但我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your god may be a deadbeat, but mine …
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.19,0:39:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们的却就在这世上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine walks the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.00,0:39:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你偷袭不了恶魔 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't gank demons, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.27,0:39:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被你们家除名了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're cut off from the home office,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.28,0:39:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些能力就用不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you ain't got the juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.49,0:39:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你还能干什么呢 你这没用的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what can you do, you impotent sap?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.58,0:40:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以干这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.42,0:40:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 死亡骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hello, death.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.83,0:40:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,当局宣布\N{\fnArial\fs30}The government has declared.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.07,0:40:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,保尔丁县进入紧急状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}A state of emergency for paulding county,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.60,0:41:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括马里恩 斐尔维尔和迦太基镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Including the towns of marion, fetterville, and carthage.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.48,0:41:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据报道 暴风警报已开启\N{\fnArial\fs30}The storm system has reportedly touched off.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.59,0:41:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一区域存在很多龙卷风\N{\fnArial\fs30}A number of tornadoes in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.63,0:41:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡人数还无法估计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death tolls have yet to be estimated.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.65,0:41:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但州政府预计生命和财产损失\N{\fnArial\fs30}But state officials expect the loss of life and property.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.38,0:41:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be staggering.
